Change List:

- Dual Sensors support
    Setup:
      SDK firmware:  3.10\sdk\t23\1.1.2-double
      prudynt-t:  1.1.0
      libimp:  1.1.0
      sensor:  sensor_gc1084_t23.ko,  sensor_gc1084s1_t23.ko, 
      sensor-iq:  gc1084-t23.bin/gc1084s1-t23.bin (version 2.20)
    Stream definition:
      Stream 0:  H264, First sensor, full resolution, RTSP channel 0, OnVif profile 0
      Stream 1:  H264, Second sensor, full resolution, RTSP channel 1, OnVif profile 1
      Stream 2:  MJpeg, First sensor, full resolution, WebUI camera 1
      Stream 3:  MJpeg, Second sensor, full resolution, WebUI camera 2

- Tiled Motion Detection (Motion.cpp)
  WebUI:  service-motion-map
    white light control.
    define ROIs in a 8x6 tiles or a boxed area.
    auto motion tracking with weighted ROI.
- Stream image settings:  
  WebUI:  config-streamer
    Image correction controls:
    Camera 1:  stream 0, stream 2
    Camera 2:  stream 1, stream 3
    Camera 1/2:  All streams
- Direct GPIO control (ctrls_hal.cpp)
  GPIO definition from file (/tmp/environment)
  Acquired GPIO definition: 
    white light
    ir850
    ir940
    ircut
    mipi sensor switch
- Direct Motor command (Motor.cpp)

Bug List:

- Can not change WB settings.
- DGain cause exposure chasing.
- Manual AGain does not work.
  
